# cgap-popcorn-aoq ontology — single source of truth for the repop frontend surface.
# GENERATED by scripts/gen_ontology.py — do not hand-edit; regenerate instead.
# Standing: UNVERIFIED (ggen-marketplace admission deferred; C17 gate literal pass pending).
# Grounding: three pinned 64B frames (IntentFrame 0x4946 / HyperplaneRegister 0x4850 /
# ReceiptFrame 0x5246), LAYOUT_VERSION 1, FNV-1a32 over bytes [0x00,0x3C) at offset 0x3C —
# adopted row-for-row from kernel/crates/repop-abi/src/layout_spec.rs.

@prefix cp: <urn:cgap-popcorn-aoq:> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
